        "@type": "Review",
        "reviewRating": {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "ratingValue": "5"
        },
        "reviewBody": "What a fantastic recipe.  I thinned the blue cheese dressing with a little water and I added a small amount of homemade Sherry vinaigrette to the salad.  I also swapped the spinach (which my husband is allergic to) and the kale (which we only like cooked) for mixed lettuces, but otherwise followed the recipe exactly. It was PERFECTION and beautifully complemented the NY Strip steak we had for dinner.  \r\nI plan to make this scrumptious salad often.",
